clintonvaugh@comcast.net wrote on 07/05/2003 13:13:

> Can anyone tell me how to grow an existing LSM volumn under Tru64 v5.1a?

You might try volassist growto and growby but this is not lvm/jfs. LSM and
ADVFS or LSM UFS are completely independent and do not have a way to grow
the advfs with a change in the size of the LSM volume. You can of course use
advfs addvol  and rmvol to walk the old LSM volume out leaving the domain on
extra temp storage you have added, then grow the LSM volume stick it back in
and then remove the temp's. Need more details of what why your asking the
question aka what are you trying to achieve.




